WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.730
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:07.050
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.100
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.210
<i>I also have a woman who's 
precious to me: Saria.</i>

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.780
<i>And yet, now there's Artoria-san, too?!</i>

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.620
Accept her!

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.990
I love you, too, Ar.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.030
Now Ar and I are together, too!

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.630
<i>N-Now I have two beautiful women!</i>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.970
<i>How is my life in another 
world meeting compliance?!</i>

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.420
This is sudden, but Seiichi-kun...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.150
Talk normally.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.860
And you don't have to do those 
hip thrusts while we're eating.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.150
What is it, Guscle-san?

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.490
Right, right! You all still 
don't own a horse, do you?

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.410
A horse?

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.980
A horse...

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:03.600
is something every 
high-ranking adventurer needs!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.230
For battle,

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.870
for traveling long distances,

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.450
for carrying luggage...

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:11.370
Horses are must-haves!

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:13.880
And most importantly,

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:19.510
horses are partners that form 
strong bonds with their adventurers!

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.430
It matches your underwear?!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:26.540
Now! Strike while the iron 
and protein shake is hot!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.940
Whoa, whoa!

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.690
Go buy a horse here!

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.390
Where were you keeping that?

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:44.180
Sheesh... I wound up coming all by myself.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.770
I'll go help out at the orphanage!

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.840
Sorry, I have a backlog of quests.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:54.960
What kind of map is this, anyway?

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:58.810
Is this the place?

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.230
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.230
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:35.130
<b>Lulune Appears!</b>

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.370
Excuse me!

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.020
Welcome!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.280
Um, I'd like to buy a horse.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.530
Are you here to enter the Royal Cup, too?

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.600
Royal Cup?

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:48.560
It's a race around the walls 
for horse-like creatures.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.110
Anything goes, even armed obstruction!

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:55.540
Since it's so dangerous, 
top rankers earn extravagant prizes.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.640
Wow, I didn't know there was 
a competition like that.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.170
We have great horses here!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.550
If you want to win, you'll want our horses!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.600
<i>I didn't say a thing about entering...</i>

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.680
This one's a dragon horse,

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.300
the most popular kind among adventurers.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.810
This is a deer horse.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.370
Despite its looks, it has twice the 
horsepower of the dragon horse.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.900
With a face like that?!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.440
They're pretty useful if you train them well!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:27.780
Huh?!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.910
I-It died!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.040
Are you kidding me?!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.860
Deer horses die easily 
because they're so dumb.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.590
They'll forget to breathe and die.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.470
They'll hit a bump in the road and die.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.550
The slightest impact, and they'll die!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.470
It's a tense run where even the 
slightest error leads to instant death,

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:50.490
but the catharsis you get when 
you pull it off is unbelievable!

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.560
This isn't <i>Spe***ker</i>...

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.020
That just leaves...

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.920
this one.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:05.070
She's a truly wild mare who hasn't warmed 
up to anyone since she was born here.

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.330
I really can't recommend this one.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.170
She's a donkey, not a horse..

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.370
And violent, too?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.430
Is she saying something?

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.850
<i>Skill: Comprehend All Languages acquired.</i>

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.620
Don't touch me like that with your 
filthy hands, you bald rubbish!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:40.110
The only ones who can touch 
me are those I deem worthy!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.540
You talk a lot for a donkey.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.710
Huh?!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.610
Who are you?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.910
Huh? U-Um...

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.220
You can understand what I'm saying?

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.590
Then get in here.

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.890
Uh, sure...

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.870
P-Pardon me.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.880
That was close.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:09.390
This is ridiculous.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.000
Hup.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.390
And hup.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:18.540
<b>Flailing</b>

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.060
P-Put me down! Put me down!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.400
No way.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.730
If I do, you'll just try to kick me again.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.650
I... I give up.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:28.520
You have made your power painfully clear.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.540
Huh? Why the sudden change?

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.660
Please forgive me for my earlier rudeness.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:40.420
You are the one fit to be the 
master I serve for my entire life!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.890
Huh?

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.920
Well, okay, then.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.270
Nice to meet you, uh...

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.420
It's Lulune, Master!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.560
Mama! Mama!

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.430
Mister, please sell me this donkey.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.740
Huh?!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.910
What school are you from?!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.940
I'll beat you up!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.700
C-Come again.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:23.250
I'm going outside for the 
first time in my life!

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.010
Wh-What is that smell?

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.970
<b>G
r
o
w
l</b>

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.580
You want to eat some good food?

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:34.600
C-Can I?!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.320
Sure. I'll buy it for you.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.730
Y-You will?!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.310
Two of those, please.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.350
Here are your grenades.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.230
What a kind person!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.100
Time to eat.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.840
So good!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.640
The moment you bite into the soft meat,

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.740
the juices practically 
explode in your mouth!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.770
It's a real meat grenade!

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:04.500
I never knew the outside world 
had such delicious things!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:09.560
Master! Master! 
Can I order other things, too?!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.160
Yeah, sure.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.170
I can't believe you're feeding me so much!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.260
I'll spend my whole life repaying this favor!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.380
That's getting a bit dramatic.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.770
You should enter the competition, too!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.110
Why are you hesitating?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.780
Those things aren't what I'm painting for.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:35.060
But I can't bear to see someone with your 
talent for painting rot away like this.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.780
Hold on there!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.750
Wh-Who are you?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.790
Outsiders should stay out of this.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.920
Y-You're...

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.580
Thank you so much for buying 
my painting the other day.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:56.170
Oh! I didn't know you had someone 
who recognized you, May.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:09:00.560
Don't you think you really should be 
entering the Charasty Painting Competition?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.400
<i>The Charasty Painting Competition.</i>

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.070
<i>Held one month after the Royal Cup,</i>

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:10.860
<i>it is the most influential painting 
competition in all of the Kingdom of Wimberg.</i>

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:15.740
I don't imagine a beginner like me could 
participate in such an amazing competition.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.830
That has nothing to do with it!

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:21.740
You already had your paintings bought by 
that man with the donkey, didn't you?!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.100
So you bought May's painting, eh?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.990
Well, it was a very nice painting.

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:31.100
Then, of course, you've bought one 
of my paintings, too, haven't you?

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.010
No, I haven't.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.510
What?!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.570
Impossible!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.500
You haven't bought any of my paintings?!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:41.340
Huh?

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:44.020
What is this? A triangle?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.570
Well?

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:48.110
This is my piece on the theme of

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:52.770
a young maiden's feelings as she longs 
for her lover during sunset at a beach!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:56.210
Sorry, it just looks like a triangle to me.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.780
Wh-Who's this?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.290
<b>Trembling</b>

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.050
I am Clay Berger, 
eldest son of Duke Berger,

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.580
and a prodigy of the arts.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.290
I'm pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.270
More importantly, May!

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.960
Your paintings left an impact upon my heart.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:21.800
I beg you, please enter the 
Charasty Painting Competition.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.060
But...

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.450
May.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:28.810
I think I'm going to enter the Royal Cup.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.310
What?!

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.910
If I happen to place at the top,

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:36.070
will you try entering that 
art competition too, May?

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.370
B-But isn't the Royal Cup dangerous?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.080
Aren't you scared?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:47.420
Hmm, I'd be lying if I said I wasn't.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.330
But if I can just rank at the top there,

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.340
wouldn't that give you the 
courage to move forward, too?

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.340
It's better to try and regret it later!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.040
Speaking of the top ranks,

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:07.600
that artistically delicious 
Tambuli is one of the prizes.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.170
Tambuli?

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.270
The legendary gigantic fish.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.020
It's the prize for fifth place, I think?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.740
The taste is practically art!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:21.480
L-Let's enter for sure, Master!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.860
Okay, okay.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:25.640
Speaking of, what is with this donkey?

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:28.370
You're not entering with 
this donkey, are you?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.290
I-I am.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.050
<i>Now, it's that time of year again!</i>

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.690
<i>Time for the annual Royal Cup race!</i>

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.930
Lulune-chan!

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:50.020
Good luck!

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.940
I'll be cheering for you from the front row!

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:54.390
Yeah!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.700
Tambuli! Tambuli! Tambuli!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:05.480
They're all incredible.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.950
Now, the Royal Cup is about to start!

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:15.210
I'm your announcer, one of 
the Valkyries, Lorna Kirizas!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.720
Seiichi!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:22.220
Good luck!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:26.470
Now, let's introduce this 
year's extravagant prizes!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.970
Tambuli, Tambuli...

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:33.210
The first and second prizes 
this year are super hot!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.250
First, we have this!

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:37.000
The second place prize is...

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.990
precious sexy photos of our 
Valkyrie captain, Louise-sama!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.330
Huh?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.980
Louise-sama!

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.490
Louise! Louise!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.240
Huh?!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:53.000
And of course, our grand prize is...

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:57.500
a ticket to spend a day with us Valkyries!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:04.520
Valkyries! Valkyries! Valkyries!

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:10.120
Valkyries! Valkyries! Valkyries!

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.950
That's some excitement.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:11.550
Master! Let's make sure to aim 
for fifth place and the Tambuli!

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:12.440
Y-Yeah!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.680
Um, Seiichi-san...

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.940
Hey, Seiichi.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.250
Why are you two here?

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.780
To give you encouragement.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:24.560
Seiichi-san, this race 
really is too dangerous.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:25.950
You should withdraw.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.870
Everyone's always afraid of that first step.

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:36.330
But if someone can give your back 
a push, you can move forward.

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.500
It was the same way for me in the past.

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:45.340
So this time, I want to help someone—help you.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.600
All right! Let's do this!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.220
Now, everyone!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.600
Are you ready to start?!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.110
The rules are simple!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.760
Once you start and exit the main gate,

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.490
you must run a lap around the walls

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.380
and return once more to the 
goal in the main grounds.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:10.100
During the race, any obstruction of 
your fellow competitors is allowed,

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.480
so, of course, your skill as a rider,

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:16.620
and as an adventurer, will matter greatly.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.880
Tambuli, Tambuli, Tambuli!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.750
Now, the gate is opening!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.630
Royal Cup...

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.630
Ready...

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:29.900
Go!

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:38.140
Whoa! The deer horses!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.700
Hey, what happened to Johnson?!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.500
Run! Run now!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.480
H-He's dead!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.900
They died from shock when the cannon sounded!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.860
That's what happens when 
you cheap out on horses!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.160
What a laughingstock!

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:58.660
Roughly twenty have dropped out at once!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.420
The other racers have all safely exited the—

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.030
or not!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.420
Lulune! What's wrong?!

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.160
Hey, come on!

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:11.150
Run already!

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.950
Quit screwing around!

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:17.560
I bet my entire fortune on 
you two! Take this seriously!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.750
What was that man thinking?!

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.690
I wonder what's wrong.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.300
Are you not feeling well?

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.520
Actually, this morning...

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.440
This morning?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:32.970
I was looking forward to the Tambuli 
so much that I skipped breakfast.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.690
What?!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.950
<b>G
r
o
w
l</b>

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:37.950
<b>G
r
o
w
l</b>

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.800
Jeez.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.270
Do I have anything to eat?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.710
The Fruit of Evolution cultivation set!

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.340
Lulune, eat this.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.260
Huh?

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:55.260
Move, move, move, move!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.220
That's foul play!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.350
Out of the way, out of the way!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.230
I'm going to win the grand prize!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.480
That's my line!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.490
Now, the leading group is finally 
entering the middle phase of the course!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.860
Now that it's come to this,

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.110
I'll use this Summon Wolf Whistle

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:18.490
to eliminate everyone!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.990
Summon Wolf Whistle? What's that?

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:24.070
Now, here I go!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.750
Come forth, you beasts!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.760
Hey! Aren't those Grand Wolves?!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.520
No one said there would be B-Rank monsters!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.530
Why is there a Hell Wolf, 
an A-Rank monster, here?!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.970
Seiichi-san...

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:05.670
Will he be okay?

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:14.920
Everyone, I'm sad to say that since it's 
become too dangerous, this year's race must—

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.430
What's this? Something's 
coming at incredible speed...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.390
It's racer Seiichi!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.480
Seiichi!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.990
Lulune-chan!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.470
Fight on!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:35.070
The surprises never end with him around!

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.420
Seiichi-san!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.570
Now this is getting interesting!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.290
I'm rocking too hard and getting motion-sick!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.830
Please slow down!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.410
Is it because of that fruit I ate earlier?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.830
I can't control myself!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.370
That donkey's charging in!
Is everything okay?!

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:53.840
Donkeys are a wolf's favorite meal!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.340
Right now...

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.160
I can go anywhere!

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.910
S-She jumped?!

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.610
Get out of my way, trash!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.730
Now, get her, Hell Wolf!

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.120
Move.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.200
Whoa!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.260
Hmph. Damn trash.

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:56.070
Th-Thanks, Lulune.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:19:00.690
W-We have to fight against them now?

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.720
I-I'm forfeiting.

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:04.830
Me, too.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.080
U-Uh, the race...

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.580
Oh, right! The race is still ongoing!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:13.120
Hurry, Lulune!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:15.330
Roger that, Master!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.340
So the race continues...

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.850
The winners are Hiiragi Seiichi and Lulune!

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:29.520
Huh?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.340
He won!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.510
They did it, Ar!

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:37.860
That's the man I fell for!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:43.220
At any rate, now you can paint 
with without worry, right?

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.830
Yes! I have an image in mind.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:48.370
I'll start working on the painting now.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.740
I see.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:52.370
Then I'm not going to lose, either!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:53.840
Yes!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.130
I screwed up!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.540
The fifth-place Tambuli!

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.010
C'mon, cheer up.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.890
I mean, you won.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.350
I don't want that!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.590
Hey, Lulune.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.360
I know it didn't work out this time,

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.050
but there will be other chances.

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:20.240
Besides, I'm sure there's even more 
delicious food out there in the world.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.050
Thank you for doing your best today.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.300
I'll follow you my whole life!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.350
I-I get it! Just calm down!

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:42.980
Seiichi, you in here?

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.570
S-Seiichi?!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.420
Seiichi!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.430
Lulune?

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:58.770
Huh?

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.030
Master!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:06.030
Huh?!

