the languages of all kinds of creatures.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:23.190
I see.

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:24.500
Wow.

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:28.420
No, seriously, this isn't the 
time to be doing this segment!

